# This is a placeholder for a bounce sound file
# To add a real bounce sound:
# 1. Download a short bounce/click sound (MP3 or WAV format)
# 2. Rename it to "bounce.mp3" 
# 3. Replace this file with the actual audio file
# 4. Update the App.js to use require('./assets/bounce.mp3') instead of the URL

# Recommended sound characteristics:
# - Duration: 0.1-0.3 seconds
# - Format: MP3 or WAV
# - Volume: Moderate (not too loud)
# - Type: Soft click, bell, or gentle bounce sound 